# This repository is public, and whatever was pushed once can stay in forks and
# caches for good.  So the list works the other way round: everything is hidden,
# and only what is named here may go up.  New files stay local until somebody
# decides otherwise - tests/test_repository.py keeps this list from growing by
# accident.
/*
!/.github/
!/.gitignore
!/repository.yaml
!/README.md
!/KOMPATIBILITAET.md
!/myhome_scs_mqtt/
!/tests/
!/testgeraet/

# Inside the allowed folders: what tools leave behind ...
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
._*

# ... and what would describe a real installation, including the variants a second
# installation or a backup ends up with.
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.log
devices*.yaml
devices*.yml
discovered*.json
options*.json
scan_result*
.env
*.pem
*.key
